              "worked": "Use a vertical scale from 0 to 900 students, with major intervals of 200 students. Draw equal-width columns with heights 225, 125, 54, 815, 620 and 411 for Science, Medicine, Law, Arts, Commerce and Engineering respectively. Include a title and label both axes.",
